amethyst (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Dev Kit release.
  * Ships amethystc (x86-64 GAS backend), amethyst-new helper,
    examples, templates, README and man pages.
  * Depends on gcc + binutils so beginners never build the compiler by hand.

